    "en": {
      "trackName": "Joker Party",
      "description": "Joker Party is a classic Old Maid card game designed for family and friends.\n\nWith simple rules and familiar gameplay,\nplayers take turns drawing cards, forming pairs,\nand trying not to be the one left holding the Joker.\nIt’s easy to learn and fun for players of all ages.\n\nThe game supports 2–6 players,\nwith both offline play and online matches through Game Center.\nYou can also choose between one or two decks to match your preferred pace.\n\nA highlight of Joker Party is Joker customization.\nUsing Genmoji, you can personalize the Joker card and add a friendly, playful touch to every game.\n\nWhether it’s a family gathering or a casual get-together with friends,\nJoker Party offers a simple and enjoyable way to play together.",
      "releaseNotes": "iPhone Duo: great in every posture!\n\nFolded: Exit and Scores move to the vertical bar on the right, giving the table more room. Turn it sideways for the table on the left and your hand on the right.\n\nHalf-open: Stand it up like a book or a laptop and the screen splits at the fold. One half shows the table, the other holds your hand, and nothing sits on the fold.\n\nMore improvements: A cleaner results screen.",
